'''Frostfire Axe''' is a version of [[Nord Axe]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Slash|slash damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is a slow but powerful overhead swing, ''perfect'' for removing tree stumps that are too low to hit with a normal swing.

An upgraded Nord Axe will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Axe.

